{
 "model": "super",
 "scope": "Nemotron 3 Super (NVFP4) on one B300, vLLM fork with SketchSSM (Model Runner V2), util 0.95, no prefix caching. C=2K uses the compact hybrid KV layout (as the paper) and C=8K the default layout; max_model_len = C + 128 (2304 at 2K). One cohort of B random-token prompts of C tokens, released into decode together, 128 decode steps; per step = mean model-forward GPU time over steps 16-111. Throughput: unprofiled, 2 repeats, each arm up to its own capacity endpoint (block pool // 8 * 8). Breakdown: one nsys-profiled cohort at B=512 for every arm; step = GPU span of the decode step, Others = the rest (convolution, norms, MoE routing, casts, gaps). Standard uses the B300 selective_state_update config in configs/.",
